data/artifacts/*
data/artifacts/**
!data/artifacts/embeddings/
!data/artifacts/embeddings/.gitkeep
!data/artifacts/spreadsheets/
!data/artifacts/spreadsheets/.gitkeep
# 구 경로 (레거시) — settings.py 기준 경로는 data/artifacts/spreadsheets/
data/spreadsheet_artifacts/
